     "only": 0,
     "mean_rank": 0.591,
     "local": true,
     "class": "free"
    },
    {
     "id": "S05-B5-p2",
     "text": "到144–147小节，才像几次深呼吸，或一声深深的叹息，紧绷短暂松开。",
     "votes": 0,
     "only": 0,
     "mean_rank": 0.591,
     "local": true,
     "class": "free"
    },
    {
     "id": "S05-B2-p2",
     "text": "里面可以同时有愤怒、悲伤，也有想维护自己的那股劲。",
     "votes": 0,
     "only": 0,
     "mean_rank": 0.682,
     "local": true,
     "class": "free"
    }
   ],
   "lines": [
